……，\n也许我们都要死在这场战争中。\n&貂蝉\n……………。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":3332,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[302],[]]},"end":182,"end_off":3791},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,119,0,53,47,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n貂蝉！你现在马上从这里逃走吧。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n哎？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,3,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n就到曹操那去吧。\n&貂蝉\n曹操……？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n曹操好像很喜欢你，\n一定会对你恩宠有加的。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n看来我好像没办法活在这个乱世了。\n不过你还得活下去…………。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n……奉先，我不走。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n为什么！？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n我也要和你一起作战。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":3791,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[302]]},"end":194,"end_off":4084},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,119,0,53,47,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n貂蝉，现在马上逃离此城吧。\n&吕布\n不论如何都要活下去。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,3,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n趁现在还能逃走。\n你一定活下去！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n……奉先，我不走。\n&吕布\n什么！？\n&貂蝉\n我也要和你一起作战。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n奉先，我们还没有输。\n&吕布\n貂蝉……可是……。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,17,0,53,49,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n这么垂头丧气的，\n怎么也不像你啊。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n我要和奉先在一起，\n直到最后一刻。\n&貂蝉\n请你别再叫我走。\n&吕布\n……好吧。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[17,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n我就让曹操见识一下，\n我吕布天下无双的神勇。\n&貂蝉\n是。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,17,0,53,53,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,0]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[15]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[837,53,27,2,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n父亲大人！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n喔？是舞衣？"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,837,0,53,42,2]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[837,4]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n曹軍要開始攻城了，\n咱們還是設法突圍吧！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n說的是，咱們快點準備吧！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[837,0]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,1,0,0,0,0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,2,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":3,"offset":4926,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":4928,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":4949,"body_end":5174,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":7,"name":"test_pending","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,3,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n出發！我就让曹操见识一下，\n我吕布天下无双的神勇。\n&貂蝉\n是。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n(眼下的父亲大人只是一艘会沉的船，\n我是否该替自己打算了？)"]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[0,0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":13,"name":"next_scene","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":5174,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":5199,"body_end":5583,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[119]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n跳過本關嗎？"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":5230,"cond":{"op":18,"name":"choice","args":["跳過\n不跳過",119]},"end":24,"end_off":5575},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":5254,"cond":{"op":19,"name":"test_choice","args":[1]},"end":20,"end_off":5528},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[568,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n少來！你以為我會這麼便宜你呀！？"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[8]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n哈哈哈哈，開玩笑的啦。\n跳過本關。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,2,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n呸！臭小子，你玩我！？"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[0,0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[205,255]},{"op":17,"name":"goto_scenario","args":[149]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":5528,"cond":{"op":19,"name":"test_choice","args":[2]},"end":23,"end_off":5573},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n呵呵，明智的選擇。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":5583,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":5608,"body_end":6052,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[17]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n奉先，眼下白门楼已经被曹军包围得\n水洩不通，我们已經无法购买粮食了。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n真是糟糕……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n沒關係，我可是天下無雙的呂布欸！\n不管敵人來幾個，我都會把他們通通\n殺光，哈哈哈哈哈哈！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n可是城內缺糧，這始終是個問題呀。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,2,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n胡說！我們沒有缺糧，\n只是剩下的糧食不夠多而已！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n……………"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n(是啊。就好比你不缺德，\n只是道德指數比較低。)"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":6052,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":6077,"body_end":7156,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[837]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n父親大人，這麼多年來您叛人無數，\n現在已經孤立無援。您是否曾後悔過？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n呸，妳只是個孩子，所以妳不懂啦。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n在這個亂世裡，本來就沒有永遠的朋友，\n只有永遠的利益。與其讓別人下手，\n還不如老子自己下手！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n可是大家都說你殺了兩個乾爹，\n已經大罪於天下了………"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n乾爹？乾爹算個屁！\n他們敢擋在本大爺的前面就得去死！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n別說是乾爹了，哪怕是親爹妨礙了\n我的利益，老子也照砍不誤！\n這才是在亂世中生存的唯一辦法！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n！！！！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[837,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕舞衣\n父親所言極是，舞衣受教矣。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n哈哈哈哈，乖女兒，妳總算是能\n理解爹的苦心了。真是有出息！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[837,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n奉先！你怎麼能這樣教育孩子呢？\n難道你希望你的孩子走你的老路嗎？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,0,2]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n貂蟬！現在是指責我的時候嗎？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n再說了，舞衣跟我一樣有什麼不好！？\n如果我不是我先殺丁原，後殺董卓，\n妳又怎麼會有機會嫁給我？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n奉先……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[17,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&貂蝉\n對不起，我不該亂說話……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n哈哈哈哈，沒事！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n人非聖賢，孰能無過？\n只要知錯能改就行啦。\n哈哈哈哈。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]}]}